heading('Current baseline and user response')
body('The current complete native environment is Rev15V2, incorporating all changes below. The user said “great” after the combined Events-plaster/open-gate delivery and requested this document update. This records acceptance of that presented direction for continuation; it does not mark website integration or hardware performance as complete. The earlier Codex/ChatGPT history and recorded approvals are retained.')
